      "timestampEdited": null,
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "> Do you happen to know if the bond tester that's said to be tentatively scheduled to be sent to me (once I commit to teaching it FlexMem bitcell stress-testing) is in China?\nyes.\n\n> Would you consider the expansion header to be reasonable to put a programmable LDO on to support as here some testing at less than the 3.3V?\nAre you referring to the 7 pin J1 header? It has the signals you'd require, a power source, gpio's and one mux channel. You do need to remove the R12 pullup on this channel though. (I'm also assuming the mux Ron is not a problem for you?)",
