      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "well the idea so far was as mentioned a DAC giving an additive offset to the feedback voltage as applied to the fb pin of an adjustable LDO.\nBecause in essence those are just op-amps with single ended output and the positive input hard-tied to whatever reference voltage they are specified to.",
